4. **A tiny “dead‑zone” around the goal (p ∈ [0.45, 0.5]) is useful.** Once the car is close to the top, continuing to accelerate right does not improve the score and may even overshoot the termination condition. Switching to “do nothing” (action = 1) as soon as p ≥ 0.5 finishes the episode cleanly.

