| **B – Convert stored energy into forward motion** | `-0.55 ≤ position < 0.5` | `action = 2` (full right thrust) | Keeps the car accelerating right *even if* its velocity is still negative, preserving the momentum that will carry it up the right hill. |
| **C – Terminate** | `position ≥ 0.5` | `action = 1` (no thrust) | Episode ends; any extra thrust would only add an unnecessary -1 penalty. |

