| **Already moving right while still left of the valley (p < ‑0.55, v > 0)** | `a=2` (push right) | Reinforces the rightward momentum. |
| **Approaching the bottom (‑0.55 ≤ p < ‑0.20, v < 0)** | `a=0` (push left) | Prevents the car from sliding back into the left hill. |
