| **General forward motion (v > 0)** | `a=2` (push right) | Keeps the car climbing the right hill. |
| **Close to the top (p ≥ 0.45, v > 0)** | `a=1` (coast) | Avoids overshooting the goal, saves steps. |
| **Goal reached (p ≥ 0.5)** | `a=1` (idle) | Episode terminates, no more penalty. |

