| 5 | `position <= -0.55 and velocity >= 0.0`                                 | 2      |  # have turned right – start accelerating right |
| 6 | `-0.20 <= position <= 0.20 and abs(velocity) < 0.02`                    | 2      |  # dead‑zone in the middle – start building momentum right |
| 7 | `velocity > 0.0`                                                         | 2      |  # any positive speed → accelerate right |
| 8 | `velocity < 0.0`                                                         | 0      |  # any negative speed → accelerate left |
| 9 | *otherwise*                                                             | 1      |

**Why these rules work**

