## Bottom line  

*The third strategy (‑98.7) was the clear winner, but it still wastes a few steps by accelerating right even when the car already has enough forward momentum.*  

The revised rule‑set above keeps the essential ideas of that strategy (push right early, coast on the hill) while adding two small but powerful refinements:

