**Take‑away:**  
The most important factor is **not to waste time coasting** while the car still has a negative (or very small) velocity.  The moment the car is moving rightwards we should keep feeding it right‑ward thrust until we are close enough to the goal that a small “coast‑to‑stop” will not make us fall back.

