**3. A refined rule set (the new “effective” strategy)**  

Below is a compact, deterministic policy that captures the lessons above.  
The policy is written in the same “IF … THEN …” style you have been using, but the thresholds are now *tight* and *mutually exclusive* so that exactly one rule fires each step.

```
