### 2️⃣  Revised rule‑set (the “Momentum‑aware Bang‑Bang” policy)

The new policy keeps the same three‑phase structure but refines the velocity thresholds and adds a *“reverse‑push‑left only when really needed”* clause.

```
# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# 0. Goal reached
IF position >= 0.5                         → action = 1   # do nothing

# 1. Right‑hill approach (already past the centre of the valley)
